mmary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When a unique index is created on a non-primary-key column, duplicate-value error is raised when duplicate values are inserted into the column.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:k> create table t (h int, r int, v int, primary key ((h), r)) with transactions = {'enabled' : true};\r\ncqlsh:k> create unique index t_by_v on t (v);\r\ncqlsh:k> insert into t (h, r, v) values (1, 1, 1);\r\ncqlsh:k> insert into t (h, r, v) values (1, 2, 1);\r\nInvalidRequest: Error from server: code=2200 [Invalid query] message=\"SQL error: Execution Error. Duplicate value disallowed by unique index k.t_by_v\r\ninsert into t (h, r, v) values (1, 2, 1);\r\n^^^^^^\r\n (error -300)\"\r\ncqlsh:k> select * from t;\r\n h | r | v\r\n---+---+---\r\n 1 | 1 | 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the uncommon case, when a unique index is created on a primary key column of a table instead, no duplicate-value error is raised:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:k> create unique index t_by_r on t (r);\r\ncqlsh:k> insert into t (h, r, v) values (2, 1, 2);\r\ncqlsh:k> select * from t;\r\n h | r | v\r\n---+---+---\r\n 1 | 1 | 1\r\n 2 | 1 | 2\r\n\r\ncqlsh:k> select h from t where r = 1;\r\n h\r\n---\r\n 2\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe common case of unique index on non-primary-key columns works fine and is unaffected by this issue.","closed_by":{"login":"robertpang","id":30942926,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTQyOTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30942926?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang","html_url":"https://github.com/robertpang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/377/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}